    "notes": "User product decision: shelf_100, shelf_150 and shelf_200 are 18 mm sunta and use the same white appearance as panel_197. Fresh runtime also verifies the existing 38 cm shelf projection as the leaf shelf depth. Canonical shelf Items now own depthCm=38, thicknessCm=1.8, material=sunta and defaultColor=0xffffff. The old catalog depth/thickness constants and renderer color constant are removed; createShelfModule consumes canonical Item values. Shelf heights remain parent type-level layout, and innerWidthM remains an explicit renderer fit override. Recipe quantities, parent shelf state, placement, rotation, snap/collision/connection, selection, context menu, persistence and reflow semantics are unchanged. Change Gate domains required by scene3d are marked affected for review; findings are review declarations only and no audit remediation is included."
  },
